This repository contains the implementation of StructMamba-Seg for semantic segmentation.

This codebase is built upon the DefMamba / DeformableMamba project and further extends it for semantic segmentation research and paper reproduction.

The main additions and modifications in this repository include:
- StructMamba-Seg for semantic segmentation
- boundary-context guided structural modeling components
- semantic segmentation configs, training, testing, and evaluation pipeline
- boundary and structure-sensitive evaluation tools
- project reorganization for paper-oriented release

This repository also benefits from the broader open-source ecosystem acknowledged by the upstream project, including segmentation and Mamba-related codebases.

